{"version": 2, "width": 100, "height": 34, "timestamp": 0, "title": "agentvcs \u2014 an agent driving the loop", "env": {"TERM": "xterm-256color", "SHELL": "/bin/bash"}}
[0.12, "o", "\r\n"]
[0.82, "o", "\u001b[1m== Iteration 0 — bootstrap ==\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[0.94, "o", "\u001b[2m   Agent: no .agentvcs here yet; initializing so I can version my work.\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[1.29, "o", "  $ agentvcs init --json\r\n"]
[1.41, "o", "  ✓ initialized .agentvcs (+ agent.json, AGENTS.md)\r\n"]
[1.53, "o", "\r\n"]
[2.23, "o", "\u001b[1m== Iteration 1 — first working version (fluid) ==\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[2.35, "o", "\u001b[2m   Agent goal: route support tickets to a queue.\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[2.7, "o", "  $ agentvcs commit -m v1: keyword ticket router --json\r\n"]
[2.82, "o", "  ✓ commit d9284c3063 [fluid] on main: v1: keyword ticket router\r\n"]
[2.94, "o", "\r\n"]
[3.64, "o", "\u001b[1m== Iteration 2 — evolve the GOAL, not just code ==\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[3.76, "o", "\u001b[2m   Agent: product asked to fast-track urgent tickets. Updating the goal + code.\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[4.11, "o", "  $ agentvcs commit -m v2: add urgency flag --json\r\n"]
[4.23, "o", "  ✓ commit 1ca2e86f19 [fluid] on main: v2: add urgency flag\r\n"]
[4.35, "o", "\u001b[2m   Inspecting what changed across dimensions:\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[4.7, "o", "  $ agentvcs diff --json\r\n"]
[4.82, "o", "  diff d9284c3063..1ca2e86f19\r\n"]
[4.94, "o", "      ~ agent.json\r\n"]
[5.06, "o", "      ~ router.py\r\n"]
[5.18, "o", "      ~ traces/run.jsonl\r\n"]
[5.3, "o", "      goal: 'Route incoming support tickets to the correct queue.' -> 'Route support tickets to a queue AND flag urgent ones for fast-track.'\r\n"]
[5.42, "o", "      trace: 2 -> 4 (+2)\r\n"]
[5.54, "o", "\r\n"]
[6.24, "o", "\u001b[1m== Iteration 3 — a BAD idea (regression) ==\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[6.36, "o", "\u001b[2m   Agent: let me 'simplify' the routing... (this will overfit and break it).\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[6.71, "o", "  $ agentvcs commit -m v3: collapse routing (experimental) --json\r\n"]
[6.83, "o", "  ✓ commit 0a7a55d460 [fluid] on main: v3: collapse routing (experimental)\r\n"]
[6.95, "o", "\u001b[2m   Agent runs its eval... billing tickets now misrouted. Accuracy dropped.\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[7.07, "o", "\r\n"]
[7.77, "o", "\u001b[1m== Iteration 3 ↩ — ROLLBACK the regression ==\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[7.89, "o", "\u001b[2m   Agent: that made it worse. Restore the full prior state (code + goal + trace).\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[8.24, "o", "  $ agentvcs rollback --json\r\n"]
[8.36, "o", "  ↩ rolled back to 1ca2e86f19 (was 0a7a55d460)\r\n"]
[8.48, "o", "      goal now: 'Route support tickets to a queue AND flag urgent ones for fast-track.'\r\n"]
[8.6, "o", "\u001b[2m   Verify the good code is back:\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[8.72, "o", "\u001b[2m   router.py restored to v2 logic ✓\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[8.84, "o", "\r\n"]
[9.54, "o", "\u001b[1m== Iteration 4 — the proper improvement ==\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[9.66, "o", "\u001b[2m   Agent: add a real 'refunds' queue instead of collapsing everything.\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[10.01, "o", "  $ agentvcs commit -m v4: add refunds queue (eval passes) --json\r\n"]
[10.13, "o", "  ✓ commit d4a897e080 [fluid] on main: v4: add refunds queue (eval passes)\r\n"]
[10.25, "o", "\r\n"]
[10.95, "o", "\u001b[1m== Freeze — crystallize the trusted solution ==\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[11.07, "o", "\u001b[2m   Agent: this is solid. Freeze it to a deterministic, temperature-0 recipe.\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[11.42, "o", "  $ agentvcs freeze --json\r\n"]
[11.54, "o", "  ❄ crystallized a0a3970ee9 from d4a897e080\r\n"]
[11.66, "o", "      deterministic recipe: ~/agentvcs/examples/agent-loop-demo/workdir/crystal/d4a897e080e2.json\r\n"]
[11.78, "o", "\r\n"]
[12.48, "o", "\u001b[1m== Final history ==\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[12.83, "o", "  $ agentvcs log --json\r\n"]
[12.95, "o", "  a0a3970ee9 [crystallized] crystallize d4a897e080e2\r\n"]
[13.07, "o", "  d4a897e080 [       fluid] v4: add refunds queue (eval passes)\r\n"]
[13.19, "o", "  1ca2e86f19 [       fluid] v2: add urgency flag\r\n"]
[13.31, "o", "  d9284c3063 [       fluid] v1: keyword ticket router\r\n"]
[13.43, "o", "\u001b[2m   The crystallized recipe (what makes re-runs cheap & reproducible):\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[13.55, "o", "\r\n"]
[13.67, "o", "{\r\n"]
[13.79, "o", "  \"type\": \"crystal\",\r\n"]
[13.91, "o", "  \"source_commit\": \"d4a897e080e2c5c4b4247c30039263327e60abdbe5e34d104509e3f9a831ecb1\",\r\n"]
[14.03, "o", "  \"goal\": \"Route tickets across billing/tech/refunds/general AND flag urgent ones.\",\r\n"]
[14.15, "o", "  \"models\": [\r\n"]
[14.27, "o", "    {\r\n"]
[14.39, "o", "      \"model\": \"claude-opus-4-8\",\r\n"]
[14.51, "o", "      \"params\": {\r\n"]
[14.63, "o", "        \"temperature\": 0,\r\n"]
[14.75, "o", "        \"top_p\": 1\r\n"]
[14.87, "o", "      },\r\n"]
[14.99, "o", "      \"provider\": \"anthropic\",\r\n"]
[15.11, "o", "      \"type\": \"modelpin\",\r\n"]
[15.23, "o", "      \"version\": null\r\n"]
[15.35, "o", "    }\r\n"]
[15.47, "o", "  ],\r\n"]
[15.59, "o", "  \"steps\": [\r\n"]
[15.71, "o", "    {\r\n"]
[15.83, "o", "      \"content\": \"Classify by keywords into billing/tech/general.\",\r\n"]
[15.95, "o", "      \"role\": \"planner\"\r\n"]
[16.07, "o", "    },\r\n"]
[16.19, "o", "    {\r\n"]
[16.31, "o", "      \"content\": \"Implemented keyword router.\",\r\n"]
[16.43, "o", "      \"role\": \"worker\"\r\n"]
[16.55, "o", "    },\r\n"]
[16.67, "o", "    {\r\n"]
[16.79, "o", "      \"content\": \"Add urgency flag; return structured result.\",\r\n"]
[16.91, "o", "      \"role\": \"planner\"\r\n"]
[17.03, "o", "    },\r\n"]
[17.15, "o", "    {\r\n"]
[17.27, "o", "      \"content\": \"Added urgent detection.\",\r\n"]
[17.39, "o", "      \"role\": \"worker\"\r\n"]
[17.51, "o", "    },\r\n"]
[17.63, "o", "    {\r\n"]
[17.75, "o", "      \"content\": \"Add dedicated refunds queue.\",\r\n"]
[17.87, "o", "      \"role\": \"planner\"\r\n"]
[17.99, "o", "    },\r\n"]
[18.11, "o", "    {\r\n"]
[18.23, "o", "      \"content\": \"Implemented refunds routing; eval passes.\",\r\n"]
[18.35, "o", "      \"role\": \"worker\"\r\n"]
[18.47, "o", "    }\r\n"]
[18.59, "o", "  ]\r\n"]
[18.71, "o", "}\r\n"]
[18.83, "o", "\r\n"]
[19.53, "o", "\u001b[1m== Done ==\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[19.65, "o", "\u001b[2m   An agent did all of this with only --json output and stable error codes:\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[19.77, "o", "\u001b[2m   iterate → inspect per dimension → rollback a mistake → freeze when trusted.\u001b[0m\r\n"]
